EST Gee was in his bag during this era EST Gee really had the pandemic era in a chokehold. While everyone was stuck at home, his music was everywhere, and “Lick Back” became one of those tracks that instantly took over. The Louisville rapper brought a raw energy that felt completely different from what was dominating the scene at the time, turning every release into something fans had to pay attention to.

This staying in rotation for y’all, or nah?

